                <pb facs="0398" n="286" sameAs="frus:frus1918/pg286"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 837.51/253</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Cuba</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Gonzales</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Habana</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-07-28T11:00:00-05:29">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">July 28, 1917, 11 a.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Cuban Senate has passed House bill authorizing 30,000,000-dollar loan with the
                    accompanying tax measure providing for interest and sinking fund. This bill
                    carries tax one-quarter of a cent a gallon on molasses produced in Cuba.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Gonzales</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
